      "en": "Modern ESLint uses a **flat config** (`eslint.config.js`): an ordered array of settings. With **typescript-eslint** and type-aware rules such as **no-floating-promises**, which catches the most dangerous async mistake: a promise with no await or catch (week 13!)."
